{"3059250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Violet Mansion", "steam_appid": 3059250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/1ac0606e03facd3d886ff4b67a86a07e.webp?t=1780696236\" width=390 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;...find what has been calling out to you for all these years.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were selected to join  a team sent into an abandoned mansion to retrieve an artifact of upmost importance. When you arrive at the mansion, you find it overrun with monsters all with one common goal: to get rid of you in brutal fashion. Solve complicated puzzles, cooperate with your team, use whatever you can find to survive and reach that artifact alive. It will not be an easy journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/25f1f1b7f7a5c2e93dfa34c956ad7adb.webp?t=1780696236\" width=390 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Soul Extinguished&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your journey, you will meet a huge variety of ... things, trying to stop you and your team. All of these creatures have unique abilities and behavior. Observe them, understand how they work, and survive against them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them are swift...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/618b935415108f17be0c693532db0ebc.poster.avif?t=1780696236\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/618b935415108f17be0c693532db0ebc.webm?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/618b935415108f17be0c693532db0ebc.mp4?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...some  will catch you off guard...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/dd893700fd5435369ac08306bd74bb65.poster.avif?t=1780696236\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/dd893700fd5435369ac08306bd74bb65.webm?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/dd893700fd5435369ac08306bd74bb65.mp4?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and some just refuse to give up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/0cec9cd30a59f1f3f0c53798af7d52fb.poster.avif?t=1780696236\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/0cec9cd30a59f1f3f0c53798af7d52fb.webm?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/0cec9cd30a59f1f3f0c53798af7d52fb.mp4?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/7ead6af6094a7ff2af442281463afb74.webp?t=1780696236\" width=390 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;The remnants of an old curse still dwells within the pages of this book.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your time in the mansion, you will run into many items you can use to increase your chance of survival and deal with problems in rather... creative ways. Use anything you can find to make sure you stay alive as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From simple glow-sticks, explosives, and radios...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/8abf6afcbb5f16d9e2d20c0894ea9246.poster.avif?t=1780696236\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/8abf6afcbb5f16d9e2d20c0894ea9246.webm?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/8abf6afcbb5f16d9e2d20c0894ea9246.mp4?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... to spell books that can create black holes and stop time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/b6175913ca1ff98624cd00603af02aea.poster.avif?t=1780696236\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/b6175913ca1ff98624cd00603af02aea.webm?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/b6175913ca1ff98624cd00603af02aea.mp4?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/eb7fbbff597f69955b3da84110ca369c.webp?t=1780696236\" width=390 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;I will be there soon, to check for myself.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperation is crucial for survival. You might not be able to deal with certain problems and creatures alone, but together, your chances will be significantly higher. Use the proximity chat and other communication features to cooperate your way to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/7f8062219b7cafab09e354f1ac4d7961.poster.avif?t=1780696236\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/7f8062219b7cafab09e354f1ac4d7961.webm?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/7f8062219b7cafab09e354f1ac4d7961.mp4?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or don't, screwing your teammates over can be a fun and viable strategy too. They can't kill you if they are too busy killing someone else after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/261747f5defd8e1988dae845ae3e4151.poster.avif?t=1780696236\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/261747f5defd8e1988dae845ae3e4151.webm?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/261747f5defd8e1988dae845ae3e4151.mp4?t=1780696236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/0f5a76d9b047d5d08e8c20a346aa17cf.webp?t=1780696236\" width=390 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Do you remember what she told you that day?&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/023e3cc93ef6d471a29694027a508c3f.avif?t=1780696236\" width=926 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mansion is full of secrets, stories and other mysteries for you and your team to find and uncover. Find out how the mansion became what it is, what took place in it years ago, and why you are really there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059250/extras/1ac0606e03facd3d886ff4b67a86a07e.webp?t=1780696236\" width=390 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;...find what has been calling out to you for all these years.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were selected to join  a team sent into an abandoned mansion to retrieve an artifact of upmost importance. When you arrive at the mansion, you f